From mark Fri May 16 20:32:24 1980
To: MOON@MIT-MC
Subject: a new network news program

Can you specify on ITS that you only want to receive messages about
certain subjects?  Network news has newsgroups to which you can
subscribe.  If I understand msgs correctly (we are running something
here that was copied from msgs) everything goes into one group and
you get to look at the first line or two to decide if you want to see it.
This causes a problem here - too much junk mail gets thrown around.
Your msgs is also somewhat local in nature, although so is ITS so
that's probably all you need.

	Mark

